---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'; const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL; const href=(value:string)=>`${base}${value.replace(/^\//,'')}`; const sample={apiVersion:'connectionagent.io/v1alpha1',kind:'FiveGCSimStandaloneConfig',contractVersion:'v1',spec:{process:{listen:'127.0.0.1:8787'},world:{worldRef:'world-standalone',worldGeneration:'g1',seedProfile:'registered-active-pdu-sessions-v1',seedParameters:{supis:['001010000000001','001010000000002'],networkPolicy:{dnn:'internet',sst:1,sd:'000000',pduSessionId:10,fiveQi:9}}}}}; const startCommand='go run ./cmd/ca-5gc-sim serve-standalone --config ./standalone.json --log-level info'; const inspectCommands='curl http://127.0.0.1:8787/identity\ncurl http://127.0.0.1:8787/healthz\ncurl http://127.0.0.1:8787/v1/world';
---
<SiteLayout title="ca-5gc-sim Standalone" lang="zh"><section class="hero"><span class="eyebrow">ca-5gc-sim / Standalone</span><h1>单独启动模拟器</h1><p class="lede"><code>serve-standalone</code> 可以把模拟器单独跑起来，不依赖 Sandbox、Service Fabric、Lab 或 Runtime。内部仍使用同一套 WorldStore、FactReader、OperationService 和 HTTP API。</p><div class="page-tabs"><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/')}>概览</a><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/api/')}>HTTP API</a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">1 / 配置</span><h2>最小配置</h2></div></div><pre><code>{JSON.stringify(sample,null,2)}</code></pre><p class="source-note">配置格式：<code>FiveGCSimStandaloneConfig.v1</code>。</p></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">2 / 启动</span><h2>启动</h2></div></div><pre><code>{startCommand}</code></pre><p>启动成功后会打印 <code>READY</code>、监听地址、world 和 generation。Standalone 只监听 loopback。</p></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">3 / 查看</span><h2>查看状态</h2></div></div><pre><code>{inspectCommands}</code></pre><div class="notice">Standalone 适合本地验证模拟器本身。Service Fabric 的消息交付、Network Observation、drop/delay/reorder、response-loss 等场景，仍要跑集成环境。</div></section></SiteLayout>